@AllInOne.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5200

### 1. Get order dashboard (Dapper)
GET {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders

### 2. Get order by ID (MediatR & EF Core)
GET {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1

### 3. Create a new order (FluentValidation, EF Core, Stateless, MassTransit, CAP, Hangfire, OTel, Serilog)
# @name createOrder
POST {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerName": "John Doe",
  "customerEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "items": [
    {
      "productName": "Enterprise Laptop Pro",
      "quantity": 1,
      "unitPrice": 1200.00
    },
    {
      "productName": "Wireless Mouse",
      "quantity": 2,
      "unitPrice": 25.00
    }
  ]
}

### 4. Transition order status (Stateless)
@orderId = {{createOrder.response.body.id}}
POST {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/transition?trigger=Approve

### 5. Run order approval workflow (Elsa)
POST {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/approval-workflow

### 6. Download invoice PDF (QuestPDF)
GET {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/invoice-pdf

### 7. Export orders to Excel (ClosedXML)
GET {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/export-excel

### 8. Export orders to CSV (CsvHelper)
GET {{AllInOne.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders/export-csv
